  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><p style=\"font-family:Poppins;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><strong>Nerdy America</strong> makes bold, funny golf polos designed to stand out on and off the course. Our designs are built around humor, golf culture, and all-American vibes — made to get laughs, compliments, and attention.</p><p style=\"font-family:Poppins;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><strong>What makes us different:</strong><br>We focus on high-converting designs at an affordable price point, making it easier for your audience to actually buy. Our products are perfect for short-form content and go viral naturally.</p><p style=\"font-family:Poppins;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><strong>How affiliates can earn:</strong><br>Earn <strong>15% commission on every sale</strong> you drive. With strong conversion rates and engaging products, there’s real earning potential whether you’re just starting or scaling content.</p><p style=\"font-family:Poppins;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><strong>How to promote us:</strong><br>Best results come from TikTok, Reels, and lifestyle content — show the fit, reactions, and personality behind the designs.</p><p style=\"font-family:Poppins;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><strong>Other information:</strong><br>We’re growing fast and looking for creators who want to grow with us 🚀</p></div>",
